#NEXUS

[ torcidafernández-baldor2017a_fig20: Constrained topology, read by eye. Polytomies: Lusotitan, Europasaurus, Bellusaurus, Camarasaurus, (Euhelopus, Galvesaurus) and the rest (six); and the five brachiosaurid branches. MACRONARIA, printed in two lines on the root stem, is kept as the root's label. The Templeton-test text on the right is not part of the tree. 18 tips, 2 polytomies (6, 5 children); 1 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Sample 9 case (census 3, seed 20261272). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

